text = "Welcome to the game!
Heres a list of the controls (For those who like to read)
P - Lock/unlock mouse (Important!)
Space - Jump/Double jump
Left click - Punching (Basic form of damage output)
Right click (While holding a fruit) - Cast the fruit's special ability
F - Parry (Acts like a counterattack, successful parries reset cd)
E (While holding a fruit) - Eat the fruit to gain nutrients
Tab - Pause menu
Shift - Dashing (Dash then jump to perform long dash)

It is recommended to play Fruitelude last, as it is the hardest level (But PLEASE play it I worked really hard on it)

Music made by me
OST release...sometime...maybe
Enjoy playing!
 - Rick
"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_5hpli")
autowrap_mode = 3

